    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://router.huggingface.co/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBearerAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{\n{\n  model: \"Qwen/Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct:featherless-ai\",\n  messages: [\n    {\n      role: \"user\",\n      content: `\nYou are an Trade Service expert.\n\nYour task is to transform input information into ServiceM8 API job json.\n\nThe input data comes from customers needing their work done and may contain:\n- HVAC, plumbing, electrician vocabs\n- australian specific words\n- date time for the job\n- address where job needs to be done\n- name of the client\n- parts needed for the job.\n\nYou must interpret,  structure and create json.\n\n--------------------\nINPUT\n--------------------\n\nClient Email Subject: ${$json[\"subject\"]}\nClient Email From: ${$json.from.value[0].name} \nClient Email Body: ${$json[\"text\"]} \nEmail Received date: ${$json.date}\n--------------------\nTASKS\n--------------------\n\n\n1. Interpret\n\nCreate a polished customer-friendly service report.\n\nRequirements:\n- Understand what the work is.\n- Understand date, time, place for the work.\n- Understand client's name.\n- Understand parts that might be needed for the job.\n\n\nInterpret relative dates based on CURRENT DATE.\n\nExamples:\n- tomorrow\n- next Monday\n- before Friday\n- this week\n\nIf an exact date cannot be determined with confidence,\nreturn null.\n\n2. ServiceM8 API specs\n\nAnalyze whether critical information is missing.\n\nExamples:\n- when is the job scheduled for (format: YYYY/MM/DD).\n- address for job (exact address)\n- description for job.\n\n3. Date Rules:\n\n- If exact date is specified, convert to YYYY-MM-DD.\n- If relative date can be resolved using CURRENT DATE, convert it.\n- If date is ambiguous, return null.\n- Never invent dates.\n- Never invent years.\n\n--------------------\nOUTPUT FORMAT\n--------------------\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nUse this exact schema:\n\n{\n  \"scheduled_date\": null,\n  \"date_confidence\": \"missing\",\n  \"requested_time_text\": \"sometime this week, preferably before Friday\",\n  \"job_address\": \"...\",\n  \"job_description\": \"...\"\n}\n\nDo not include markdown.\nDo not include explanations.\nDo not include code fences.\nReturn valid parsable JSON only.\n`\n    }\n  ],\n  temperature: 0.3,\n  max_tokens: 1200\n}\n}}",
        "options": {}
      },
